;; cubus.im — the DNS records GitHub Pages needs, as a BIND zone file for Cloudflare.
;;
;; Import it from the Cloudflare dashboard: the cubus.im zone › DNS › Records › Import and Export
;; › Import DNS records › choose this file. Cloudflare reads the `cf_tags` comment on each line
;; and creates the record DNS-only ("grey cloud"); if the import dialog offers to proxy the
;; imported records, leave that unticked. They must stay DNS-only: GitHub issues the site's
;; certificate by looking the name up itself, and a proxied record hides the Pages servers
;; behind Cloudflare's addresses, so the issuance never completes and Enforce HTTPS stays greyed
;; out.
;;
;; Before importing, delete any existing A, AAAA or CNAME record on `cubus.im` and on `www`, or
;; the old address answers beside the new ones. The four A and four AAAA addresses are GitHub
;; Pages' published set; the www CNAME points at the account's Pages host, and GitHub redirects
;; it to the apex because the apex is the site's custom domain (a setting on the Pages site,
;; made by hand; a workflow deployment ignores public/CNAME). TTL 1 is Cloudflare's "Auto".
;;
;; Imported 2026-09-06 — and the records came in PROXIED, tags notwithstanding: GitHub's own
;; health check read `is_proxied: true, is_https_eligible: false` for both names. The site
;; serves through Cloudflare that way, but GitHub cannot issue its certificate or enforce HTTPS
;; until every one of these is switched to DNS-only in the dashboard.
;;
;; site.test.mjs holds this file to exactly those records.

$ORIGIN cubus.im.
$TTL 1

cubus.im.	1	IN	A	185.199.108.153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
cubus.im.	1	IN	A	185.199.109.153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
cubus.im.	1	IN	A	185.199.110.153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
cubus.im.	1	IN	A	185.199.111.153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
cubus.im.	1	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8000::153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
cubus.im.	1	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8001::153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
cubus.im.	1	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8002::153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
cubus.im.	1	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8003::153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
www.cubus.im.	1	IN	CNAME	xiaolai.github.io. ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
